PomAROS VM - AROS distribution

Open System, Tools, Utilities and Prefs for the standard AROS applications.
From a Shell, for example:

  CPUInfo
  SYS:Tools/Editor
  SYS:Utilities/MultiView
  SYS:Utilities/Clock

Save your documents on WORK:. System files and saved preferences persist too.
Control+Option+Escape releases the mouse and keyboard to macOS. Click the VM
window to return to AROS. Quit the application normally to flush the disk.

The Mac clipboard synchronizes with AROS clipboard unit 0. Individual programs
provide their own Copy/Paste commands. VMExchange transfers files through the
profile's Shared folder; text and supported images can use the clipboard.

Installing the application preserves existing profiles; it does not update an
already initialized guest disk. The immutable seed is used for a new profile. Zed, Ferail and third-party hosted PomAROS applications are not
part of this distribution. See the LICENSE files for AROS licensing.
